  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mfenced><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>6</mn><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mrow></mrow></msub><mo>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Use, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;U</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>&#916;n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>RT</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3263.5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8.314</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>298</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&#160;</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>3267</mn><mo>.6</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>kJ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
